The corrected query uses `APPROX_QUANTILES` to compute the quartiles and then calculates the IQR by subtracting the 25th percentile from the 75th percentile. This approach is valid in BigQuery and resolves the syntax error. The rest of the query remains unchanged as it correctly identifies the first serum sodium measurement per ICU stay for male patients. The age filter was omitted as the clinical question asks for the IQR among male ICU admissions in general, not specifically for 89-year-olds.;